{
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "name": "Get daily Indeed job alerts in Google Sheets with Apify",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "overview-0001",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -520,
        -240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 460,
        "height": 760,
        "content": "## Daily Indeed job alerts in Google Sheets\n\nEvery morning this workflow searches Indeed for jobs that match your keywords and adds the new ones to a Google Sheet: one row per job, with salary, job type, remote and the links. Good for job seekers, recruiters and anyone tracking hiring in a niche.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Every morning** starts the workflow at 8:00.\n2. **Search Indeed** runs the [Indeed Jobs Scraper](https://apify.com/robertosan16/indeed-jobs-scraper) on Apify. It searches any of 62 countries, and with `onlyNew` it returns only jobs it has not returned before for the same search, so the sheet gets no duplicates.\n3. **Pick columns** keeps the fields for the sheet.\n4. **Add to sheet** appends one row per job.\n\n### Set up\n1. Create a free [Apify account](https://console.apify.com/sign-up) and add an Apify credential to the **Search Indeed** node: the API token from Apify Console \u2192 Settings \u2192 API & Integrations, or OAuth on n8n Cloud. If the Apify node is missing, install the verified community node `@apify/n8n-nodes-apify`.\n2. In **Search Indeed**, change the search: `searchQueries`, `country` (a two-letter code such as `US`, `GB` or `DE`) and `location`.\n3. Create a Google Sheet whose first row holds the column names: Title, Company, Location, Salary, Job type, Remote, Posted, Job link, Apply link. Connect Google Sheets and select the sheet in **Add to sheet**.\n4. Activate the workflow.\n\n### Cost\nThe scraper charges $1 per 1,000 jobs. The Apify free plan includes $5 of usage every month."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "search-note-0002",
      "name": "Search note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "### Your search\nEdit the JSON: keywords, country and city. `postedWithinDays: 1` and `onlyNew: true` keep each run to the jobs that are new since yesterday. More filters: job type, remote, experience level, distance."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "every-morning-0003",
      "name": "Every morning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        40,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "search-indeed-0004",
      "name": "Search Indeed",
      "type": "@apify/n8n-nodes-apify.apify",
      "position": [
        300,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "memory": 512,
        "actorId": "robertosan16~indeed-jobs-scraper",
        "timeout": null,
        "resource": "Actors",
        "operation": "Run actor and get dataset",
        "customBody": "{\n  \"searchQueries\": [\n    \"data analyst\"\n  ],\n  \"country\": \"US\",\n  \"location\": \"New York, NY\",\n  \"postedWithinDays\": 1,\n  \"onlyNew\": true,\n  \"includeDescription\": false,\n  \"maxItems\": 200\n}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "pick-columns-0005",
      "name": "Pick columns",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        560,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "column-1",
              "name": "Title",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.title }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "column-2",
              "name": "Company",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.companyName }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "column-3",
              "name": "Location",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.location }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "column-4",
              "name": "Salary",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.salary ? $json.salary.text : '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "column-5",
              "name": "Job type",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.employmentType || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "column-6",
              "name": "Remote",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.remote ? 'yes' : '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "column-7",
              "name": "Posted",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.postedAt ? $json.postedAt.slice(0, 10) : '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "column-8",
              "name": "Job link",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.jobUrl }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "column-9",
              "name": "Apply link",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.applyUrl }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "add-to-sheet-0006",
      "name": "Add to sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        820,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "columns": {
          "value": {},
          "schema": [],
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {},
        "operation": "append",
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.6
    }
  ],
